<title>USA: Nations Balanced sets qtly income dividend.</title>
<headline>Nations Balanced sets qtly income dividend.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of directors of Nations Balanced Target Maturity Fund Inc said on Tuesday its quarterly income dividend per share will be $0.105, representing earnings for the quarter ending December 31 1996.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on December 30 to shareholders of record on December 13. The previous quarterly income dividend was also $0.105.</p>
<p>Nations Balanced Target is a diversified, closed-end management investment company.</p>
